/// The size of a program page, in bytes.
///
/// Mirrored from the kernel. `brk` is rounded to this granularity on both
/// sides, so a guest that guessed wrong would ask for a length the kernel
/// silently adjusts — which is why the value is shared rather than assumed.
pub const PAGE_SIZE: usize = 4096;

